Z||000000||fiero56||07-29-2001||10:50 PM||||I'm thinking up colors for my rebuilt 2.8 for the rocker covers and upper plenum. I'm thinking a smoke gray color. I haven't been able to dig up any pics of this color on a Fiero. The factory red is everywhere, I want something different, and so far, have never seen grey anywhere.<P>Anyone have pics of this setup?||||reg||1
